<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firm buys 20,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firm buys 20,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the Philippine's largest food and beverage firm's bought 20,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for January shipment, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The firm clinched a deal for a combined U.S. spring and western white wheat consignment on Wednesday night through a Japanese commodity house, Manila traders told Reuters.</p>
<p>The price at which the wheat was purchased could not be immediately determined.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
